OL,3,GNEWSA'Bonfire Night firework bangs sent
OL,4,Ame back to the battlefield'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's quite severe. There's been
OL,7,Foccasions when it has made me sick."
OL,9,FSimon West joined the army when he was
OL,10,F16 years old, going on to be posted in
OL,11,FGermany and Northern Ireland before
OL,12,Fserving in the First Gulf War.
OL,14,FWhile he eventually left the army and
OL,15,Fmoved back into civilian life, his
OL,16,Fmilitary service never really left him.
