OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'Bonfire Night firework bangs sent
OL,4,Ame back to the battlefield'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest, who lives in north Solihull,
OL,7,Fsuffers from post-traumatic stress
OL,8,Fdisorder (PTSD) and one of his major
OL,9,Ftriggers is fireworks, with the flashes
OL,10,Fand bangs dragging his mind back in
OL,11,Ftime.
